# The Requirements service reads these AI__* variables. `aspire run` and `aspire deploy` fill
# them from the AppHost's Aspire parameters (see README: "Point it at a live model"), so this file
# is a reference for a direct service run or a hand-started `docker compose --env-file` run.
# Never put a real key in a committed file.
AI__PROVIDER=fixture
AI__MODEL=gpt-5-mini
AI__ENDPOINT=https://api.openai.com/v1
AI__APIKEY=

# OpenCode Go (optional).
# AI__PROVIDER=opencode-go
# AI__MODEL=glm-5.3-flash
# AI__ENDPOINT=https://opencode.ai/inference/go/openai/v1
# AI__APIKEY=
